{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-staircase-partition","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:staircase-partition","kind":"definition","title":"Staircase partition $\\rho_k = (k, k-1, \\ldots, 1)$","tags":["staircase-partition","young-diagram","self-conjugate","hecke-algebra","specht-module","ew-residual"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Hecke.staircasePartition","text":"staircase-partition.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:staircase-partition\"></a><p><em>For each <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\geq 1</code>, the <strong>staircase partition</strong> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_k = k(k+1)/2</code> is</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\rho_k \\;:=\\; (k,\\, k-1,\\, \\ldots,\\, 2,\\, 1)\n  \\;\\vdash\\; \\tfrac{k(k+1)}{2}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>The staircase partition is self-conjugate: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_k = \\rho_k'</code> under transposition of rows and columns.</em></p>\n<p>The staircase shapes index Specht modules of the Iwahori–Hecke algebra that play a distinguished role in the electroweak sector. The canonical minimal braid word acts on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{\\rho_k}</code> with a spectrum encoding the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-deformed Weinberg-angle ratio.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/staircase-partition.md","heading":"Definition","number":"13.2.11","page":"b/def-staircase-partition","qa":{"counts":{"pass":82,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.Hecke.staircasePartition","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/BraidKnotOctonion/Staircase.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
